kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "app-tui-input"
purpose: "Editor 操作区、取消/退出键位、steer 与 follow-up、信任后 yolo。"
valid_scope[1]: src/app/tui/
requirements[21]{req_id,title,statement}:
  meta0,"capability-shell","本 capability 由变更 c450-revise-app-tui-contract 引入；归档合并后以 delta 增补的 requirements 为准。本壳 MUST 保持非空以满足 BDD 护栏。"
  ati1,"editor-operation-zone","输入区 MUST 使用 xylitol-tui Editor，并保留上下边框作为操作区边界；选择器打开时 MUST 替换 editor 槽而非画到内容顶部。"
  ati2,"cancel-and-ctrl-c","流式或 agent 忙碌时 Esc MUST 调用 Driver::abort；Ctrl+C 在编辑器非空时 MUST 清空输入，在编辑器为空时 MUST 退出 TUI。"
  ati3,"steer-and-followup-keys","agent 忙碌时普通 Enter MUST 将当前输入作为 steer 入队；Alt+Enter MUST 将当前输入作为 follow-up 入队（等待当前 agent loop 全部完成后再执行）。"
  ati4,"yolo-after-trust",在项目已信任前提下，TUI MUST NOT 实现逐工具审批确认流程；工具默认执行；MUST 保留 hook 扩展点供日后追加策略。
  ati5,"double-esc-session-tree",空编辑器下双 Esc（时间窗与 demo 一致）MUST 打开会话树；树打开时 Esc MUST 关闭树并还原 editor 槽。
  ati6,"demo-steer-followup-morphology","在产品 Driver 接线前，packages/xylitol-tui 的 agent_demo MUST 以假队列验证 ati3 键位：agent 忙碌时普通 Enter MUST 将输入作为 steer 入队且 MUST NOT 清空或中止当前轮的脚本/流式调度；Alt+Enter MUST 将输入作为 follow-up 入队并仅在完全空闲后开新轮；footer MUST 在队列非空时展示 steer/follow-up 计数。"
  ati7,"demo-steer-preserves-turn","agent_demo 在 steer 入队时 MUST 将 steer 文本写入 transcript（可带 [steer] 标记）并可挂到会话活树；MUST NOT 调用会清空 scheduled_actions/pending_events 的新一轮 queue_simulated_turn 入口来「顶替」当前忙碌轮。"
  ati8,"demo-bash-prefix-border",agent_demo 中当编辑器文本 trim 后以 ! 开头时，Editor 操作区边框 MUST 切换为 bash 强调色（对齐 DESIGN success 前景）；去掉 ! 前缀后 MUST 恢复默认 muted 边框。
  ati9,"demo-external-editor-stub",agent_demo MUST 将 Ctrl+G 绑定为外部编辑器原型：记录调用并写入系统提示；MUST NOT 在 harness 路径强制 spawn 真实 $EDITOR；MAY 向编辑器追加 stub 标记以演示往返。
  ati10,"product-host-key-wiring","产品 HostSession MUST 在 agent 忙碌且会话树关闭时将普通 Enter 映射为 Driver::steer、Alt+Enter 映射为 Driver::follow_up；忙碌时 Esc MUST 调用 Driver::abort 并 clear_queue(steer=true, follow_up=false)；MUST NOT 在忙碌 Esc 时打开 c491 stub 树。"
  ati11,"product-queue-chrome","产品 TUI 在 steer/follow-up 队列非空时 MUST 在 scrollback 与 status 之间以 muted 色渲染 Steering:/Follow-up: 行及 Alt+Up dequeue 提示（对齐 pi pendingMessagesContainer；实现为 queue strip）；MUST NOT 将排队内容写成 scrollback System [steer]/[follow-up] 墙；Alt+Up MUST 将队列文本还原进 editor 并 clear_queue(steer=true, follow_up=true)。"
  ati12,"product-queue-uplink","当 steer/follow-up 从队列注入 agent history 时，runtime MUST 发射 MessageStart/MessageEnd（role=user，带 message）；产品 bridge MUST 将其提交为 scrollback UiEntry::User（与 idle 提交同形）；queue strip 随 QueueUpdate 消退后用户文本 MUST 仍留在 transcript；MUST NOT 仅在 strip 闪现后丢失。"
  ati13,"product-editor-send-history","产品 Host 在 idle 提交、busy steer、busy follow-up 发送用户文本时 MUST 调用 Editor::add_to_history（跳过空串与连续重复）；同一 TUI session 内 MUST 能在 editor 空或已在浏览态时用 ↑/↓ 召回这些文本（委托包 ed05）；MUST NOT 要求跨进程持久化。"
  ati14,"product-abort-resumable","产品 TUI 在用户 Esc abort 当前流之后 MUST 回到可提交 idle（follow-up restore 语义不变）；MUST NOT 让后续用户输入持续产生粘性 aborted Error 而无法继续对话。"
  ati15,"product-bash-prefix-border",产品 TUI 中当编辑器文本 trim 后以 ! 或 !! 开头时，Editor 操作区边框 MUST 切换为 bash 强调色（对齐 DESIGN success 前景）；去掉该前缀后 MUST 恢复默认 muted 边框。
  ati16,"product-idle-bang-execute","产品 idle 且会话树关闭时，Enter 提交以 ! 或 !! 开头的非空命令 MUST 调用 Driver::execute_bash（经 Command::Bash / dispatch），MUST NOT 调用 Driver::run；!! 前缀 MUST 设置 exclude_from_context=true，单 ! 为 false；命令体为空时 MUST 提示且 MUST NOT 执行。"
  ati17,"product-external-editor-stub","产品 Host MUST 将 Ctrl+G 绑定为外部编辑器入口：至少记录/系统提示或 stub 回写；harness 路径 MUST NOT 强制 spawn 真实 $EDITOR；真编辑器路径 MAY 使用 with_terminal_suspended 边界（对齐 design/bash-mode.md）。"
  ati18,"editor-slot-machine-live-tree","产品 TUI MUST 以显式 EditorSlot（至少含 Editor 与 Tree；MAY 含 Plate/Settings/Choice）互斥替换 editor 槽；打开任一非 Editor 槽时 MUST 替换贴底 editor 区而非画到 scrollback 顶部；Esc MUST 优先关闭当前槽并还原 Editor；忙碌时 Esc MUST 仍 abort（ati10）且 MUST NOT 打开 Tree；Tree 槽 MUST 由 Driver MessageHistory 活树驱动（见 app-tui-session-tree），MUST NOT 再冻结为仅假树 stub。"
  ati19,"bang-esc-aborts","产品 TUI 在交互 !/!! bash 执行期间 MUST 视为忙碌：Esc MUST 调用 Driver::abort 以取消该 bash（进程树按 c660）；host MUST NOT 在 drain_pending 内独占 await bash 以致无法读键盘；取消后 MUST 回到可输入 idle。"
  ati20,"bang-busy-hard-reject","产品 TUI 在交互 bang 仍 busy（bash_active）时，用户再次 Enter 提交 ! 或 !! 命令 MUST 硬拒绝：MUST 向用户给出简短提示、MUST 恢复编辑器文本（或等价保留命令体）、MUST NOT 调用第二次 Driver::execute_bash、MUST NOT 排队第二 bang；忙碌时非 bang 前缀文本 MUST 仍按既有 steer 规则处理。"
scenarios[34]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  meta0,"shell-present","","列出 llmanspec/specs/app-tui-input",spec.toon 存在且 purpose 为中文
  ati1,"selector-slot","",打开模型选择器,editor 槽被选择器替换且贴底可见
  ati2,"esc-aborts","",流式中按 Esc,"Driver::abort 被调用"
  ati3,"alt-enter-followup","",忙碌时 Alt+Enter 提交文本,"消息进入 follow-up 队列而非立即 steer"
  ati4,"no-tool-modal","",信任目录下工具执行,无逐工具审批 UI 且 hooks 仍可注册
  ati5,"esc-closes-tree",会话树已打开,按 Esc,树关闭且 editor 槽恢复
  ati6,"busy-enter-steer",agent_demo 轮次忙碌且编辑器有文本,按 Enter,steer 队列长度增加且状态仍为忙碌类（Thinking/Working/Drafting 等）
  ati6,"alt-enter-followup",agent_demo 轮次忙碌,Alt+Enter 提交文本,"follow-up 队列长度增加且会话树尚未出现该 follow-up 的 user 节点"
  ati6,"footer-counts","steer 或 follow-up 队列非空",渲染 footer,"footer 含 steer:N 或 follow-up:N"
  ati7,"steer-no-abort",已 submit 进入 Thinking 且 scheduled_actions 非空,再次 Enter 提交 steer 文本,scheduled 流式/工具动作仍可继续推进而非被立即清空为仅 Ready
  ati8,"bang-enables-bash",编辑器文本为 !ls,sync 边框,bash_mode 为真
  ati8,"clear-bang-restores",曾处于 bash 模式,文本改为 hello 后 sync,bash_mode 为假
  ati9,"ctrl-g-stub",编辑器有文本,Ctrl+G 或 stub API,external_editor 计数加一且 transcript 含 external editor stub
  ati10,"busy-enter-steer",产品 host 忙碌且 editor 非空,按 Enter,steer 被调用或 pending steer 入队且 editor 清空
  ati10,"busy-alt-enter-followup",产品 host 忙碌,Alt+Enter 提交文本,"follow_up 被调用或 pending follow-up 入队"
  ati10,"busy-esc-abort",产品 host 忙碌且树关闭,按 Esc,abort 被请求且不打开会话树
  ati11,"busy-steer-strip",产品 host 忙碌且已入队 steer,渲染一帧,"出现 Steering: 行且无 scrollback [steer] System 墙"
  ati11,"busy-followup-strip","产品 host 忙碌且已入队 follow-up",渲染一帧,"出现 Follow-up: 行与 Alt+Up hint"
  ati11,"busy-alt-up-dequeue",产品 host 忙碌且队列非空,按 Alt+Up,队列文本进入 editor 且请求 clear 两侧队列
  ati12,"steer-inject-scrollback",busy 且 steer 已注入,收到 user MessageStart,scrollback 出现对应用户行
  ati12,"followup-inject-scrollback","follow-up 注入后 QueueUpdate 清 queue strip",渲染,"Follow-up 文本仍在 UiEntry::User 中"
  ati13,"submit-then-up",idle 提交过非空 prompt 且 editor 已空,按 ↑,editor 回填该 prompt
  ati13,"steer-in-history",busy 发送过 steer 文本,idle 后 editor 空再按 ↑,可召回该 steer 文本
  ati14,"esc-then-submit",TUI busy 中 Esc abort 后,再 idle Enter 提交,新一轮开始且无连续 aborted Error 墙
  ati15,"bang-enables",editor 文本为 !ls,sync 边框,边框为 success 强调色
  ati15,"clear-restores",曾处于 bash 边框,文本改为 hello 后 sync,边框恢复 muted
  ati16,"bang-executes",idle 且 editor 为 !echo hi,Enter,execute_bash 被调用且 run 未被调用
  ati16,"bangbang-exclude",idle 且 editor 为 !!echo x,Enter,exclude_from_context 为 true
  ati16,"empty-bang",idle 且 editor 仅为 !,Enter,出现提示且未执行 bash
  ati16,"slash-wins",idle 且 editor 为 /exit,Enter,走 slash 退出而非 bash
  ati17,"ctrl-g-stub",产品 host 可测环境,Ctrl+G,不崩且有 stub/系统提示可观测
  ati18,"tree-slot-live",产品 TUI idle,双 Esc 打开 Tree 槽,槽内为 MessageHistory 活树且 Esc 可关回 Editor
  ati19,"esc-cancels-hanging-bang",产品 idle bang 已开始且 bash 未返回,按 Esc,"Driver::abort 被调用且 bash 结果 cancelled 或等价中止"
  ati20,"second-bang-rejected",第一 bang 仍在执行,再提交 !echo second,出现拒绝提示且 execute_bash 调用次数仍为 1
